ublish claimed COAs without independent verification. A few publish results from independent labs. We do the third thing — independent third-party testing with the COA published alongside the product so the data is on the table."}],"$L7","$L8"]}]]}]}],"$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc"]}],"$Ld"],["$Le","$Lf","$L10"],"$L11"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"5EBzDUx5EWFnDCeAqQDJU"}
