9:["$","section",null,{"className":"border-b border-[var(--border)]","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-4","children":"01 / Thesis"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-light leading-tight tracking-tight text-[var(--text)] mb-8","children":"Small catalog. Deep transparency. Third-party-verified accuracy."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-5 text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-[var(--text-muted)]","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["vialchemlabs"," was founded on a simple observation: the research-peptide market is large, fragmented, and trust-poor. Tier 1 vendors carry catalogs of 25+ compounds without independent third-party testing. Tier 2 vendors compete on price without compliance discipline. Tier 3 vendors are typosquats, shells, or single-thread mentions that disappear within a year."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["We started ","vialchemlabs"," because we believed there was room for a different positioning: small catalog, deep transparency, third-party-verified accuracy. Our seven opening SKUs are the canonical research peptides for recovery (BPC-157, TB-500), GH-axis (Ipamorelin, CJC-1295 no DAC), cosmetic-pathway (GHK-Cu), metabolic (MOTS-c), and nootropic (Selank) research. Each is tested by"," ","an independent third-party laboratory","per batch. Each batch's COA is published."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We do not sell tirzepatide. We do not sell semaglutide or retatrutide. We do not sell bacteriostatic water. Our positioning is not \"everything you can buy\" — it is \"everything you can verify.\""}]]}]]}]}]
